      {
        "id": 2195288562,
        "content": "### Registration Tracker\r\n- As we ramp up our recruiting efforts, we will provide incentives for developer relations managers to spread the word of the DevPool.\r\n- A major incentive is to reward the DevRel responsible for onboarding any developers that we end up hiring. \r\n- I anticipate that they can coax and encourage the new candidate to finish one task to make it to getting paid. We may even be able to automate payment generation for the DevRel in the future!\r\n### Scope\r\nWe should enable support for trackers i.e. `work.ubq.fi?devrel=diamondnegroni` and then when the developer signs up, we capture the dev and associate them with the devrel for future reference. Refer to https://github.com/ubiquity/work.ubq.fi/issues/30#issuecomment-2008148491 for implementation details. \r\n# Deadline = EthSeoul Conference 25 March 2024!",
