        "id": 2008089848,
        "content": "This issue basically reimplements [UTM tracking](https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/10917952?hl=en#zippy=%2Cin-this-article).\r\nWe can simply:\r\n1. Add Google Analytics script to work.ubq.fi\r\n2. Somehow let \"DevRel managers\" generate URLs with UTM params like `https://work.ubq.fi?utm_campaign=EthSeoul& utm_content=diamondnegroni `\r\nThis way we get:\r\n1. Quick setup\r\n2. Google Analytics dashboard UI\r\n3. Ability to export `EthSeoul` report from Google Analytics dashboard to `.csv` and then to our DB (if we really need it)",
        "url": "https://github.com/ubiquity/work.ubq.fi/issues/30#issuecomment-2008089848",
        "commentType": "ISSUE_COLLABORATOR",
